### Admin metrics query-range - nginx_request_rate (1시간, 30s step)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/metrics/query-range
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "template": "nginx_request_rate",
  "params": {
    "window": "1m"
  },
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T01:00:00Z"
  },
  "step": "30s"
}

### Admin metrics query-range - spring_http_rps_by_service (1시간, 30s step)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/metrics/query-range
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "template": "spring_http_rps_by_service",
  "params": {
    "window": "5m"
  },
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T01:00:00Z"
  },
  "step": "30s"
}

### Admin metrics query-range - spring_http_latency_quantile (p95, 1시간)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/metrics/query-range
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "template": "spring_http_latency_quantile",
  "params": {
    "quantile": "0.95",
    "window": "5m"
  },
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T01:00:00Z"
  },
  "step": "30s"
}

